Cancellation on a BoH removes cursing. Always keep a vial of holy water
outside of the BoH so that you can dip the BoH and bless/uncurse it. I keep
a sack with wands of cancellation and 1-2 vials of holy water in inventory
both to keep those wands from being put inside the BoH, and to store the
holy water somewhere safe so that I can do emergency uncursings.

If you have a scroll or know the spell remove curse, you can wield the BoH
and uncurse it that way....obviously you want to do that prior to dropping
it :)


